      "id": "m1",
      "title": "Round percentage amounts half up in invoice math",
      "status": "done",
      "plan": "Fix percentOf in src/money.js so percentage amounts round to the nearest cent with halves rounding up, instead of truncating with Math.floor. Keep money in whole cents and do not alter subtotal or the invoice composition.\n\nReported case: item 1999 cents x1, 15 percent discount, 8 percent tax. Discount 1999*15/100 = 299.85 rounds to 300. Net 1699. Tax 1699*8/100 = 135.92 rounds to 136. Total 1835 (currently 1836).\n\nAdd regression tests covering the reported order and half-cent boundaries, then run npm test.",
      "preview": null,
      "dispatch": null,
